        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: blood and soil, geopolitics\n- People: Rudolf Kjellén, a French geographer and ethnographer\n- Organizations: Nazi Party\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- A French geographer and ethnographer became notable for first using the idea that later gave rise to the slogan “blood and soil.”\n- Rudolf Kjellén was influenced by this French geographer and ethnographer.\n- The Nazi Party supported the most extreme form of this concept until the end of World War II.",
